OL,3,GNEWSABurglar targeted couple at home
OL,4,Aafter bus stop row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA burglar who targeted a vulnerable
OL,7,Fcouple in their home a day after they
OL,8,Ftold him off for trying to skip a bus
OL,9,Fqueue has been jailed for three years.
OL,11,FAnthony Young, 45, claimed he went to
OL,12,Fthe home of the pair, who did not know
OL,13,Fhim, to apologise, but then forced his
OL,14,Fway in and stole the man's wallet
OL,15,Ffollowing a scuffle, Newcastle Crown
OL,16,FCourt heard.
OL,18,FThe woman said she believed he found
OL,19,Fout where they lived and went to their
OL,20,Fhome in Walker, Newcastle, with an
OL,21,F"intention to steal" during the
OL,22,F"terrifying" ordeal.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
